<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<title>Solar Power Plant Proposal — {{customer.name}}</title>
<style>
  :root{
    /* ---- color tokens ---- */
    --navy:        #15294A;
    --navy-deep:   #0E1F38;
    --navy-tint:   #1F3D66;
    --gold:        #C2842A;
    --gold-deep:   #A06A1C;
    --gold-soft:   #F8E9D2;
    --green:       #1E7D4F;
    --green-soft:  #E3F4EA;
    --teal:        #0E7C66;
    --teal-soft:   #E1F3EF;
    --blue-soft:   #EAF0F8;
    --gray-soft:   #F1F3F5;
    --ink:         #16212F;
    --ink-muted:   #5C6B7C;
    --ink-faint:   #8B97A3;
    --line:        #E2E7EC;
    --white:       #FFFFFF;

    /* ---- spacing scale ---- */
    --sp-1: 4px;  --sp-2: 8px;  --sp-3: 12px; --sp-4: 16px;
    --sp-5: 20px; --sp-6: 28px; --sp-7: 36px; --sp-8: 48px;

    /* ---- type ---- */
    --font-sans: "Inter", "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
    --font-mono: "IBM Plex Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body{ margin:0; padding:0; }
  body{
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,h4,p,ul,ol{ margin:0; }
  ul{ padding-left: 0; list-style:none; }
  strong{ font-weight:700; }

  /* =========================================================
     PAGE / PRINT SETUP
     ========================================================= */
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }

  .page{
    width: 210mm;
    min-height: 297mm;
    padding: 13mm 14mm 11mm 14mm;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    page-break-after: always;
    background: var(--white);
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-of-type{ page-break-after: auto; }

  @media print{
    .screen-only{ display:none !important; }
  }

  /* =========================================================
     PRIMITIVES
     ========================================================= */
  .eyebrow{
    font-size:9.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.09em;
    text-transform:uppercase; color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .rule{ height:1px; background:var(--line); border:0; margin:0; }

  .pill{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center;
    padding: 5px 12px; border-radius:999px;
    font-size:10.5px; font-weight:600;
    border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--ink-muted);
    background:var(--white);
  }
  .pill--solid{ background:var(--gold); border-color:var(--gold); color:#fff; }

  .grid{ display:grid; gap: var(--sp-4); }

  .stat-card{
    border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:6px;
    padding: var(--sp-4) var(--sp-5);
    background:var(--white);
    border-left-width:3px;
    break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .stat-card__value{ font-size:19px; font-weight:800; line-height:1.15; }
  .stat-card__label{
    margin-top:3px; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .stat-card__note{ margin-top:2px; font-size:9.5px; color:var(--ink-faint); font-style:italic; }
  .stat-card--navy{ border-left-color:var(--navy);  } .stat-card--navy  .stat-card__value{ color:var(--navy); }
  .stat-card--gold{ border-left-color:var(--gold);  } .stat-card--gold  .stat-card__value{ color:var(--gold-deep); }
  .stat-card--green{border-left-color:var(--green); } .stat-card--green .stat-card__value{ color:var(--green); }
  .stat-card--ink{  border-left-color:var(--ink);   } .stat-card--ink   .stat-card__value{ color:var(--ink); }

  .callout{
    border-radius:6px; padding: var(--sp-4) var(--sp-5);
    break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .callout--gold{ background:var(--gold-soft); }
  .callout--blue{ background:var(--blue-soft); }
  .callout--green{ background:var(--green-soft); }
  .callout--teal{ background:var(--teal-soft); }
  .callout--gray{ background:var(--gray-soft); }
  .callout__title{ font-size:9.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom:6px; }

  .meta-row{
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:var(--sp-3);
    padding: 7px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:11.5px;
  }
  .meta-row:last-child{ border-bottom:0; }
  .meta-row__label{ color:var(--ink-muted); }
  .meta-row__value{ font-weight:700; text-align:right; }

  .field-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap: 0 var(--sp-6); }
  .field{ padding: 8px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .field__label{ font-size:9px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink-faint); }
  .field__value{ font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; margin-top:2px; }

  table{ width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:11px; }
  thead{ display: table-header-group; }
  tr{ page-break-inside: avoid; break-inside: avoid; }
  th{
    text-align:left; font-size:9px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.05em;
    text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--white); background:var(--navy);
    padding:8px 10px;
  }
  td{ padding:7px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); vertical-align:top; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even){ background:#FAFBFC; }
  .table-group-head td{
    background:var(--navy-tint); color:#fff; font-weight:700;
    font-size:9.5px; letter-spacing:.05em; text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .row--highlight td{ background:var(--green-soft); font-weight:700; }
  .num{ text-align:right; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; white-space:nowrap; }

  .section-head{ margin-bottom: var(--sp-5); }
  .section-head__top{ display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:10px; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .section-num{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:4px;
    background:var(--navy); color:#fff; font-size:10px; font-weight:800;
    flex:none;
  }
  .section-head__title{ font-size:16px; font-weight:800; color:var(--navy); }
  .section-head__desc{ font-size:10.5px; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-left:30px; }

  .check-list li{ position:relative; padding-left:18px; margin-bottom:6px; font-size:11.5px; }
  .check-list li::before{ content:"✓"; position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--green); font-weight:800; }

  /* =========================================================
     SHARED CHROME
     ========================================================= */
  .brand-header{ display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:var(--sp-5); }
  .brand-id{ display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px; }
  .brand-logo{ width:34px; height:34px; flex:none; }
  .brand-name{ font-size:14.5px; font-weight:800; color:var(--navy); line-height:1.2; }
  .brand-tagline{ font-size:7.6px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.09em; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-top:2px; }
  .brand-contact{ font-size:9.5px; color:var(--ink-muted); margin-top:5px; }

  .ref-badge{
    background:var(--gold-soft); border:1px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius:6px; padding:8px 14px; min-width:170px; text-align:center;
  }
  .ref-badge__eyebrow{ font-size:8px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.08em; color:var(--gold-deep); text-transform:uppercase; }
  .ref-badge__ref{ font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:var(--navy); margin-top:2px; }
  .ref-badge__dates{ font-size:9px; color:var(--ink-muted); margin-top:5px; }

  .page-footer{
    margin-top:auto; padding-top: var(--sp-4);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    font-size:9px; color:var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .page-footer strong{ color:var(--ink-muted); }

  .dark-band{ background:var(--navy); color:#fff; }

  /* =========================================================
     PAGE 1 — COVER
     ========================================================= */
  .cover-strip{
    width: 210mm;
    max-width: none !important;
    margin-left: -14mm;
    margin-top: var(--sp-6);
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding: var(--sp-6) 14mm var(--sp-5) 14mm;
  }
  .cover-strip .eyebrow{ color:#9FB0C6; }
  .cover-title{ font-size:32px; font-weight:800; color:#fff; margin-top:10px; line-height:1.1; }
  .cover-title small{ display:block; font-size:32px; font-weight:300; color:#9FB0C6; }
  .cover-subtitle{ font-size:12px; color:#C7D2DF; margin-top:8px; }
  .cover-pills{ display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top: var(--sp-5); }
  .cover-pills .pill{ background:rgba(255,255,255,.06); border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.25); color:#E7ECF2; }
  .cover-pills .pill--solid{ background:var(--gold); border-color:var(--gold); color:#fff; }

  .kpi-strip{
    margin: 0 -14mm; padding: var(--sp-6) 14mm;
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
  }
  .kpi-strip__item{ text-align:center; border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15); }
  .kpi-strip__item:first-child{ border-left:0; }
  .kpi-strip__value{ font-size:21px; font-weight:800; color:#fff; }
  .kpi-strip__label{ font-size:8.5px; letter-spacing:.07em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#9FB0C6; margin-top:4px; }

  .overview-eyebrow{ margin-top:var(--sp-7); margin-bottom:var(--sp-3); }
  .overview-grid{ grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); }
  .overview-grid .stat-card{ padding: var(--sp-3) var(--sp-4); }
  .overview-grid .stat-card__value{ font-size:16px; }

  .cover-footer{
    width: 210mm;
    max-width: none !important;
    margin-left: -14mm;
    margin-top: auto;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding: var(--sp-4) 14mm;
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    font-size:10px; color:#C7D2DF;
  }
  .cover-footer strong{ color:#white; display:block; font-size:11px; }
  .cover-footer .right{ text-align:right; }
  .cover-footer .right .eyebrow{ color:#9FB0C6; }

  /* =========================================================
     PAGE 2 — INTRO LETTER
     ========================================================= */
  .letter-layout{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.7fr 1fr; gap: var(--sp-6); margin-top:var(--sp-5); flex:1; }
  .letter-meta{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:var(--sp-4); background:var(--gray-soft); border-radius:6px; padding:var(--sp-4); margin-bottom:var(--sp-5); }
  .letter-meta__label{ font-size:8.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink-faint); }
  .letter-meta__value{ font-size:12px; font-weight:700; margin-top:2px; }
  .letter-ref{ font-size:11px; margin-bottom:var(--sp-4); }
  .letter-ref code{ font-family:var(--font-mono); background:var(--gray-soft); padding:1px 5px; border-radius:3px; color:var(--gold-deep); }
  .letter-body p{ margin-bottom: var(--sp-4); font-size:11.5px; text-align:justify; }
  .signature-block{ margin-top:var(--sp-6); }
  .signature-script{ font-family:"Segoe Script","Brush Script MT",cursive; font-size:24px; color:var(--navy-tint); }
  .signature-name{ font-weight:800; font-size:12px; border-top:1px solid var(--ink); padding-top:4px; display:inline-block; margin-top:2px; }
  .signature-role{ font-size:10.5px; color:var(--ink-muted); }

  .side-box{ border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:6px; padding:var(--sp-4); margin-bottom:var(--sp-4); }
  .side-box__title{ font-size:9px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--navy); margin-bottom:var(--sp-2); }

  /* =========================================================
     QUADRANT GRID — "Why Solar" page
     ========================================================= */
  .quad-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
  .quad-box{ border-radius:6px; padding:var(--sp-4) var(--sp-5); break-inside:avoid; page-break-inside:avoid; }
  .quad-box__title{ font-weight:800; font-size:12px; margin-bottom:var(--sp-3); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }

  /* workflow strip */
  .workflow-strip{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; background:var(--navy); color:#fff; border-radius:6px; padding:var(--sp-4) var(--sp-5); font-size:10.5px; font-weight:600; }
  .workflow-strip .seg{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }
  .workflow-strip .arrow{ color:#7E92AA; }

  .timeline-row{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:var(--sp-3); }
  .timeline-step{ text-align:center; flex:1; }
  .timeline-step__icon{ font-size:18px; }
  .timeline-step__week{ font-size:9px; color:var(--ink-faint); font-weight:700; margin-top:4px; }
  .timeline-step__label{ font-size:10.5px; font-weight:700; margin-top:2px; }

  .disclaimer-box{ background:var(--gray-soft); border-radius:6px; padding:var(--sp-4) var(--sp-5); font-size:9.5px; color:var(--ink-muted); text-align:justify; }
  .disclaimer-box__title{ font-weight:800; color:var(--ink); font-size:11px; margin-bottom:6px; }

  .signature-pad{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:var(--sp-6); padding-top:var(--sp-5); }
  .signature-pad__col{ width:45%; }
  .signature-pad__line{ border-top:1px solid var(--ink); margin-top:34px; padding-top:5px; font-size:10px; color:var(--ink-muted); }

  .qr-box{ width:62px; height:62px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:4px; background:
    repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, #16212F 0 3px, transparent 3px 6px),
    repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #16212F 0 3px, transparent 3px 6px);
    background-blend-mode: multiply; background-color:#fff;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- PAGE 1 — COVER                                                -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<section class="page">
  <div class="brand-header">
    <div class="brand-id">
      <svg class="brand-logo" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <g fill="none" stroke="#3FA75C" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round">
          <line x1="24" y1="2" x2="24" y2="11"/>
          <line x1="24" y1="37" x2="24" y2="46"/>
          <line x1="2" y1="24" x2="11" y2="24"/>
          <line x1="37" y1="24" x2="46" y2="24"/>
          <line x1="8.5" y1="8.5" x2="14.7" y2="14.7"/>
          <line x1="33.3" y1="33.3" x2="39.5" y2="39.5"/>
          <line x1="39.5" y1="8.5" x2="33.3" y2="14.7"/>
          <line x1="14.7" y1="33.3" x2="8.5" y2="39.5"/>
        </g>
        <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="9" fill="#E8862B"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <div class="brand-name">{{company.name}}</div>
        <div class="brand-tagline">INTEGRATED&nbsp; SOLAR&nbsp; AND&nbsp; POWER&nbsp; ENGINEERING&nbsp; SOLUTIONS</div>
        <div class="brand-contact">{{company.address}}<br/>
        {{company.phone}} · {{company.email}} · {{company.website}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ref-badge">
      <div class="ref-badge__eyebrow">Proposal Reference</div>
      <div class="ref-badge__ref">{{proposal.reference}}</div>
      <div class="ref-badge__dates">Date: {{formatDate proposal.date}}<br/>Valid: {{formatDate proposal.validUntil}}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cover-strip dark-band">
    <div class="eyebrow">Techno-Commercial Proposal &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{customer.state}} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{customer.category}}</div>
    <h1 class="cover-title">Solar Power Plant<small>Proposal</small></h1>
    <div class="cover-subtitle">{{system.typeLabel}}</div>
    <div class="cover-pills">
      <span class="pill pill--solid">{{system.capacityKW}} kWp</span>
      <span class="pill">{{customer.state}}</span>
      <span class="pill">{{customer.name}}</span>
      <span class="pill">{{customer.category}}</span>
      <span class="pill">Valid 30 Days</span>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi-strip">
      <div class="kpi-strip__item"><div class="kpi-strip__value">{{inr annualSavings}}</div><div class="kpi-strip__label">Annual Savings</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-strip__item"><div class="kpi-strip__value">{{paybackYears}} yrs</div><div class="kpi-strip__label">Payback Period</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-strip__item"><div class="kpi-strip__value">{{inr twentyFiveYearSavings}}</div><div class="kpi-strip__label">25-Year Returns</div></div>
      <div class="kpi-strip__item"><div class="kpi-strip__value">{{decimal co2OffsetTons 1}} T/yr</div><div class="kpi-strip__label">CO₂/Year</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="overview-eyebrow eyebrow">Proposal Overview</div>
  <div class="grid overview-grid">
    <div class="stat-card stat-card--ink"><div class="stat-card__value">{{system.capacityKW}} kWp</div><div class="stat-card__label">System Capacity</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card stat-card--navy"><div class="stat-card__value">{{inr system.totalProjectCost}}</div><div class="stat-card__label">Total Project Cost</div><div class="stat-card__note">Before subsidy deduction</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card stat-card--gold"><div class="stat-card__value">{{inr system.beneficiaryContribution}}</div><div class="stat-card__label">Customer Commitment</div><div class="stat-card__note">After subsidy — net payment</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card stat-card--green"><div class="stat-card__value">{{paybackYears}} yrs</div><div class="stat-card__label">Payback Period</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card stat-card--green"><div class="stat-card__value">{{inr annualSavings}}</div><div class="stat-card__label">Total Annual Benefit</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card stat-card--navy"><div class="stat-card__value">{{inr twentyFiveYearSavings}}</div><div class="stat-card__label">25-Year Returns</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card stat-card--gold"><div class="stat-card__value">30 Days</div><div class="stat-card__label">Proposal Validity</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="cover-footer dark-band">
    <div>
      {{customer.category}} · {{customer.state}} · {{system.typeLabel}}<br/>
      <strong>{{customer.name}} · {{formatDate proposal.date}}</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="right">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="color:#9FB0C6;">Prepared by</div>
      <strong>{{company.name}}</strong>
      {{company.phone}} · {{company.website}}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ============================================================ -->
<!-- PAGE 2 — INTRODUCTION LETTER                                  -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<section class="page">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="section-head__top">
      <span class="section-num">01</span>
      <span class="section-head__title">Introduction Letter</span>
    </div>
    <div class="section-head__desc">Formal cover letter from the Chief Executive Officer</div>
    <hr class="rule" style="margin-top:10px;"/>
  </div>

  <div class="letter-layout">
    <div>
      <div class="letter-meta">
        <div><div class="letter-meta__label">To</div><div class="letter-meta__value">{{customer.name}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="letter-meta__label">Date</div><div class="letter-meta__value">{{formatDate proposal.date}}</div></div>
        <div><div class="letter-meta__label">Valid Until</div><div class="letter-meta__value">{{formatDate proposal.validUntil}}</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="letter-ref">
        Ref: <code>{{proposal.reference}}</code> &nbsp;&nbsp;
        <strong>Subject:</strong>
        Solar Power Plant Proposal — {{system.capacityKW}} kWp On-Grid System, {{customer.state}}
      </div>

      <div class="letter-body">
        <p style="font-weight:700;">Dear {{customer.name}},</p>
        <p>Greetings,</p>
        <p>Thank you for your interest in {{company.name}}. We are pleased to present our tailored Solar Energy System proposal for your solar power plant requirement.</p>
        <p>Established in 2018, {{company.name}} is a forward-thinking renewable energy company committed to the 3P philosophy (People, Planet, Profit), delivering sustainable, cost-effective, and high-performance energy solutions across India. Headquartered in Kerala, we have successfully executed a wide range of solar projects nationwide, covering on-grid, off-grid, and hybrid systems across residential, commercial, industrial, and institutional sectors.</p>
        <p>As an MNRE-empanelled EPC firm, with empanelments from ANERT, KSEBL, MSME, JRDEA, IOCL, JNKEL, KEL, and others, we provide comprehensive end-to-end services including design, engineering, procurement, installation, commissioning, and maintenance of rooftop and ground-mounted solar power plants.</p>
        <p>We are committed to helping you reduce energy costs, lower your carbon footprint, and achieve strong returns through reliable green energy solutions.</p>
        <p>This proposal outlines our best techno-commercial offering for your solar requirements. We look forward to your confirmation and the opportunity to partner with you on this sustainable journey.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="signature-block">
        <p style="margin-bottom:2px;">Yours sincerely,</p>
        {{#if company.ceoSignatureUrl}}
          <img src="{{company.ceoSignatureUrl}}" style="height:45px; display:block; margin: 4px 0;" alt="Signature" />
        {{else}}
          <div class="signature-script">Manoj</div>
        {{/if}}
        <div class="signature-name">{{company.ceoName}}</div>
        <div class="signature-role">{{company.ceoTitle}}<br/>{{company.name}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="side-box">
        <div class="side-box__title">Proposal At-a-Glance</div>
        <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-row__label">System</span><span class="meta-row__value">{{system.capacityKW}} kWp</span></div>
        <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-row__label">Total Project Cost</span><span class="meta-row__value">{{inr system.totalProjectCost}}</span></div>
        <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-row__label">Your Commitment</span><span class="meta-row__value">{{inr system.beneficiaryContribution}}</span></div>
        <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-row__label">Payback</span><span class="meta-row__value">{{paybackYears}} yrs</span></div>
        <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-row__label">Annual Benefit</span><span class="meta-row__value">{{inr annualSavings}}</span></div>
        <div class="meta-row"><span class="meta-row__label">25-yr Returns</span><span class="meta-row__value">{{inr twentyFiveYearSavings}}</span></div>
